        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 3352, Middleton Mortise Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Middleton Mortise Handleset has a classic look that will add elegance to any entry way. The Middleton Mortise Entrance Handleset is available in both dummy and single cylinder functions. The single cylinder ANSI F20 mortise box can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. This traditional handleset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Middleton Handleset and the ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Deadlocking latch bolt with saw-proof inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick security latch.</li>\r\n<li>When the deadbolt is engaged, the outside thumb press is automatically locked.</li>\r\n<li>The latch bolt is retracted by the thumb press / knob / lever on either side, except when the outside thumb press is locked by stop button, then it can only be opened from the exterior by use of the key. Making it ideal for doors you want to automatically lock. This feature can be easily toggled on and off by pressing the stop and release button on the mortise box face.</li>\r\n<li>Operating the interior trim retracts both the deadbolt and the latch bolt for emergency egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-diagram.jpg?v=1704354539\" width=\"189\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek F20\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Middleton Mortise Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-3/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3352-specifications.pdf?v=1704262346\"><b>Emtek 3352 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Box Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Install.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3352-finish.jpg?v=1704354570\" width=\"600\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Middleton Mortise Handleset",
                "description": "The Middleton Mortise Handleset has a classic look that will add elegance to any entry way. The Middleton Mortise Entrance Handleset is available in both dummy and single cylinder functions. The single cylinder ANSI F20 mortise box can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. This traditional handleset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Middleton Mortise Entrance Handlesets, Middleton Mortise Handlesets, EMT-3352, Emtek 3352, Emtek 3052, Emtek Middleton Mortise Entrance Handlesets, Middleton Mortise Entrance Handlesets, single cylinder entry sets, traditional handlesets, transitional handlesets, traditional front door handles, classic front door handles, exterior door mortise-locksets, exterior door mortise locksets, mortise-lock keyed entry door handlesets, mortise door handle replacements,\r\nentry door hardware, EMT-F20-3352"
